OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'I lost my mum and brothers to a
OL,4,Agenetic disease'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Surrey man is hoping to raise
OL,7,Fawareness of a rare mitochondrial
OL,8,Fcondition which led to the death of his
OL,9,Fmum and two brothers.
OL,11,FGeorge O'Neill lost three of his
OL,12,Fclosest family members to Melas
OL,13,Fsyndrome - a maternally inherited
OL,14,Fdisease which can present with symptoms
OL,15,Fincluding stroke-like episodes,
OL,16,Fseizures, muscle weakness, hearing loss
OL,17,Fand fatigue.
OL,19,FThe 27-year-old, from Ash, is now going
OL,20,Fthrough the process of testing for the
OL,21,Fcondition to see how severely it will
OL,22,Faffect him.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
