OL,3,GNEWSA'I lost my mum and brothers to a
OL,4,Agenetic disease'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe hopes by sharing his story he will
OL,7,Fpromote understanding of the impact of
OL,8,Fmitochondrial conditions and encourage
OL,9,Fothers to get tested too.
